{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Data Cleansing.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Data Cleansing.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"data cleansing data cleansing","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Data Cleansing.md","fileName":"Data Cleansing.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Data Cleansing","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-13 10:30\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Cluster Data Quality and Interpretation]] · [[Evidence-Based Data Decisions]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Cluster Data Quality and Interpretation","Evidence-Based Data Decisions","clusteranalysisanddatamining.pdf","frontiersofdatascience.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Data Cleansing.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Data Cleansing.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"data cleansing data cleansing","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Data Cleansing.md","fileName":"Data Cleansing.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Data Cleansing","heading":"Data Cleansing","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Data cleansing analyzes fields, corrects or removes erroneous values, fills missing information where justified, and enforces domain and business rules. It is the activity used to improve data quality before and during analysis.\n\nCleaning is continuous because codes, systems, and real-world conditions change. Every correction should preserve provenance and distinguish error repair from deletion of a valid rare case.\n\nWithin a decision pipeline, cleansing occurs alongside extraction, transformation, integration, and storage. Each correction or exclusion changes the evidence available to later exploration and visualization, so its rules must be tied to the meaning and intended use of the data.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Cluster Data Quality and Interpretation","Evidence-Based Data Decisions